# Film reel: keep the paper trail (beat sheet, coverage, riff, QC), never the media.
# The 4K capture alone is ~262 MB; renders are larger. Media lives in course storage.
youtube/**/capture/
youtube/**/media/
youtube/**/clips/
youtube/**/audio/
youtube/**/mp3/
youtube/**/renders/
youtube/**/_qc/frames/

# Git cannot ignore by size: inspect staged files before committing (>25 MB).
